    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "misc_register: the easy path",
      "source_hash": 10542751435325653091,
      "context_hash": 3013131611411864681,
      "translation": "misc_register: 간편한 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:43.312877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For simple devices that don't need multiple minors, `misc_register` handles major/minor allocation and class creation automatically:",
      "source_hash": 16566929289887205812,
      "context_hash": 17419417325991022246,
      "translation": "여러 minor 번호가 필요하지 않은 단순한 디바이스의 경우, `misc_register`가 major/minor 할당과 클래스 생성을 자동으로 처리합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "devices": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:43.312877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "All misc devices share major number 10 — a value reserved in the kernel's official device list since at least Linux 1.3.",
      "source_hash": 9308879901190971994,
      "context_hash": 9246533817826464672,
      "translation": "모든 misc 디바이스는 major 번호 10을 공유하며, 이 값은 적어도 Linux 1.3 시절부터 커널의 공식 디바이스 목록에 예약되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "devices": "디바이스",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:43.312877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "They appear under `/sys/class/misc/`.",
      "source_hash": 5133491576802334957,
      "context_hash": 17083632463672329684,
      "translation": "misc 디바이스는 `/sys/class/misc/` 아래에 나타납니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:43.312877Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ioctl: control operations",
      "source_hash": 1568925412265413446,
